      "message": "Are there any problems with this one? Its profiles need to be populated upon device connection by the override of `Module::populateConnectedDevicePort`, see for example the USB implementation:  https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:hardware/interfaces/audio/aidl/default/usb/ModuleUsb.cpp;l\u003d124;drc\u003d57f0dcf78d2a0ecf3dc44a43fbeb9dd116fbcab9\n\nSince the legacy BT HAL did not seem to implement `getAudioPort`, I suppose we can use their hardcoded configuration from here: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/audio_hal_interface/hidl/hearing_aid_software_encoding_hidl.cc;l\u003d135;drc\u003d1740cdd7fac9f5923f5dd2a763ce11ef04b7820a",
